@startuml
!theme plain
title 直播间状态机

[*] --> CREATED : 创建房间
CREATED --> LIVING : start() / 仅主播
LIVING --> ENDED : stop() / 主播或系统
CREATED --> ENDED : cancel
ENDED --> LIVING : restart()\n仅主播
ENDED --> [*]

note right of CREATED : 未推流不可见
note right of LIVING : 可进房互动
note right of ENDED : 保留评论记录
@enduml
